From fb32cb967bab0accaeabe43f59e45a99eea5d560 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:03:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MERGE-985c44be: laptop packages 100-101 (GitHub main bdb4665,
 GitLab main 985c44be) into the machine tree

Package 100 (GitLab de4249da): the heater fuse limit TempFuseLimitType is set at boot as golden (250 / 200 / 170 by
customer, machine and temperature limit; it was 0 -- the cause of the relay dropping out after 41 s and the refused
Temp_Set saves), Motor Test HOME on a non-1203 axis runs golden's single-axis home (no effect on a PCI1203 axis:
RowIs1203 -> false), St02 MR !22 (ART LOTCLEARED / LOTRETESTCLEARED clear the 2DID list).
Package 101 (GitLab 985c44be): census 129 back-fills per golden -- tri-temp door 6 lock, ATC EMG down / up + ATC 6.0
messages / reconnect, BinCount.txt writes, Auto tray cylinders released at one-cycle finish, [I41] empty-socket check,
Loader cylinder pre-push at Initial / RT Start (cylinders move).

17 files: NEW 3 (MainFormShow_TempFuse.cpp, tests/test_tempfuse_limit.cpp, tests/test_atc_emg_bridge.cpp), OLD 9
(machine had an older laptop version, taken as is), LOCAL 5 merged three-way on the package's own base with no conflict
(WebMotorAccess.cpp / .h / WebMotorAccessLive.cpp, tests/test_web_motor_access.cpp, tools/wb_serve.cpp): the
machine's HT9050-ORG code (g_W906OrgActiveLow, W906_Ht9050OrgHomeHook) is all kept, no line duplicated by the merge.
o2: wb_serve + 5 tests build, PE 24/24 complete; ctest WebMotorAccess / TempFuseLimit / AtcEmgBridge / W7_L2_CKernel /
VacuumVc8 / MachineIoTable_HT9050 / IoPoints_HT9050 / MachineSuckers_HT9050 pass; production_audit unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
